description:
LDAvis includes the following rule (at the top of the `lda.css` file):
```css
path {
   fill: none;
   stroke: none;
}
```
which applies to all path SVG elements and removes their drawing and fill color. That makes the symbols in [scatterD3](https://github.com/juba/scatterD3)'s legend invisible (inside a Shiny app). Potentially this could create issues with other html widgets.

See issue there: https://github.com/juba/scatterD3/issues/77
